is is a bunch of npc's for a Vampire game hunting down a unicorn?<br /> Are they supposed to help the pc's? <br /> Just be fodder?</div> </div> </div> </div>yes the unicorn alias the villain is a quest for a cross over game, my player must interact and cooperate with this pack for the quest","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6052-rettile-blitch","name":"Rettile&Blitch","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-15T04:57:14-07:00","id":847619,"title":"","content":"So flesh em out however much you feel you need to, there is no such thing as a &quot;best pack &quot; however","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-15T06:53:51-07:00","id":847655,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/845743-best-choise-for-a-pack?p=847619#post847619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So flesh em out however much you feel you need to, there is no such thing as a &quot;best pack &quot; however</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes but how the roles fit better with who auspice? and what tribe they must be?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6052-rettile-blitch","name":"Rettile&Blitch","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-15T07:09:00-07:00","id":847659,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rettile&amp;amp;Blitch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/845743-best-choise-for-a-pack?p=847655#post847655\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes but how the roles fit better with who auspice? and what tribe they must be?</div> </div> </div> </div>Tell you what...<br /> <br /> Make the Ragabash a Red Talon, a wolf out of place, with a chip on his shoulder and eager to teach the lessons of the beast to these stupid monkeys that don't know better. He doesn't worry too much about the human stuff. He knows it will all fall down, but damn him if he doesn't teach the other Garou a lesson, before they fall down with the other monkeys.<br /> <br /> Make the Theurge a female Fianna druidess, inspire her with celtic mythology and have her the one who drives the pack to uncover the mystery of the Unicorn. Make her ethereal and flighty and have her talk with things that are not there. Mark her body and give her Geases to follow<br /> <br /> Make the Philodox a Bone Gnawer street preacher. A giant of a man with wild hair and glorious beard with a booming voice. A, rough, tough, no-nonsense sort, who can sit and drink your problems away of punch you until you learn your fucking lesson and man up.<br /> <br /> Make the Galillard a Silver Fang - the son of the greatest warrior the Silver Fangs ever head. The legacy of the future that will lead the Garou into the Apocalypse and carry the banner of the Fangs high. It's just... that he doesn't want to fight or to lead. He's softspoken, academic and is more interested in codifying Garou histories then gaining rank and beating people up. A Great Galilard he may be, but a terrible legacy he is.<br /> <br /> Make the Ahroun Children of Gaia. A soldier who came back from the war and doesn't want to fight unless it's truly necessary and the target is truly deserving of Gaia's Vengeance. Seeing Wyrm doing horrors to man was nothing compared to him seeing what man does to a man.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-16T00:17:22-07:00","id":848031,"title":"","content":"Good guy Asmodai, doing OP's work for them...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avata